    """Convert a sorted list of unique integers into a compact range string.

    Runs of 3 or more consecutive integers become 'a-b', others listed singly.
    Example: [-6,-3,-2,-1,0,1,3,4,5,7,8,10,11,14] -> '-6,-3-1,3-5,7,8,10,11,14'
    """
